      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>)</mo></math><div id=\"gtx-trans\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 105px; top: 37.6667px;\"><div class=\"gtx-trans-icon\">&nbsp;</div></div>",
